# Garruk, Curse Breaker's -4 sets up "Whenever one or more creatures attack one of your opponents, those creatures get
# +2/+2 and gain trample until end of turn", a delayed ability of Garruk's card (CR 603.7), whatever the object its
# ability resolves for has become. Mycosynth Lattice makes Garruk an artifact and Animate Artifact makes him a 5/5
# artifact creature; on turn 9 Cubwarden mutates over him, on top (CR 702.140c), so the merged creature is a Cubwarden
# with Garruk's loyalty abilities and his loyalty counters (CR 702.140e, 606.3). Its -4 resolves, and Memnite attacking
# Bot2 gets +2/+2 and trample: Bot2 takes 3.

